Guard: Nice boots,

4
00:00:22.437 --> 00:00:31.064
Cat! Now you may see the king!

5
00:00:31.065 --> 00:00:33.779
Puss: A gift for you, King.

6
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:40.681
It's from my owner, Carabas. King:

7
00:00:40.682 --> 00:00:51.524
My favorite mushrooms! Please

8
00:00:51.525 --> 00:01:03.466
give Carabas these gold coins. Polly:

9
00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:08.463
Carabas isn't poor anymore! Puss:

10
